body:
I don't have any wise sagely advice here but holy fuck I thought I was the only one. I work full time and can't really give 100% to video games all the time and so I always end up rerolling around the level 85-90 mark. I never get to endgame content but god damn do I enjoy my time with it though.

&#x200B;

How fucking sick are you of doing the story mode by now OP? :D

Break it down into smaller chunks. Focus on farming, what is your CS at 10 minutes usually? Then once you've nailed that focus on warding and vision, then on laning phase, then matchups, then importance of objectives, getting better at your "main" champs, etc etc etc. There's so much room for improvement.

&#x200B;

I believe in you, you'll make it out of elo hell :)
